Lab patch 0004: pin the LangChain family and openai (agentic/requirements.txt).

Why: upstream lists them with ">=" (AUTOMATION_FEASIBILITY §2.1 and §3 #6), so two
builds of the same commit can run different client code. Each is pinned to the
newest release on PyPI at or before the commit date (2026-11-19). Patch 0002's
LabTaggedChatOpenAI overrides ChatOpenAI._get_request_payload, which
langchain-openai 1.8.3 has (chat_models/base.py:3871).

